    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_441_lotus_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, hello there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_451_robin#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where am I...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_441_lotus_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "This here's my room, and it's also the prison clinic.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_451_robin#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know who you are...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_441_lotus_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know who you are too... The name's Domma.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_451_robin#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "What am I doing here...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_451_robin#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right, there was a fight, and I got dragged into the mess...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You passed out, Ms. Robin.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_451_robin#2",
        "name2": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Anthony...?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robin"
    },
    {
        "text": "How come you know my name?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_451_robin#2",
        "name2": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Domma has a list of prisoners here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_451_robin#6",
        "name2": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_451_robin#6",
        "name2": "char_264_Mountain_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're a hitman too, aren't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_451_robin#2",
        "name2": "char_264_Mountain_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_451_robin#2",
        "name2": "char_264_Mountain_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Domma found this weapon on you, and you were there. I could only arrive at this conclusion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course, if you really aren't, you are free to prove me wrong.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_451_robin#6",
        "name2": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_451_robin#6",
        "name2": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Regardless of whether that is truly the case, I hope you could at least listen to what I have to say. Everything I'll be telling you is under the assumption that you came here to kill me. I mean no offense, and I hope you don't get the wrong impression.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know who sent you here. They are the ones who orchestrated my family's downfall. They are also behind my imprisonment here for the past six years.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_451_robin#2",
        "name2": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_451_robin#3",
        "name2": "char_264_Mountain_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And I've made my decision to break out of this prison to get to the end of it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can tell your combat prowess is superb, and I'm hoping you'd be willing to abandon your contract as a hitman and come help me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's as simple as that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_451_robin#6",
        "name2": "char_264_Mountain_1#6",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_264_Mountain_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't need to give me an answer right away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "text": "I need a lot of time to prepare. You have a lot of time on your hands as well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you want to kill me, you are free to keep trying. You could also give up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you are interested in helping me, just pay the clinic a visit and let Domma know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_451_robin#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$doorknockquite",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_137#9",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Anthony, Captain Barton was wondering if you are doing okay. Are you hurt?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jailer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_264_Mountain_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nothing serious; just a few scrapes. Let him know to wait a little longer. I'll be finished here soon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_137#9"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right, not a problem. Take your time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jailer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_264_Mountain_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "I need to deal with Barton.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "text": "You should head back and think this offer through, Ms. Robin.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_bar_1",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$nightoflongmen_intro",
        "key": "$nightoflongmen_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#5",
        "name2": "char_242_mayer#2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#5",
        "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh, I thought Anthony was just some simple, kind-hearted guy, but it sounds like I'm not giving him enough credit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#5",
        "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm? What makes you say that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mayer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#5",
        "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We know for sure that Robin was there to kill him, but he didn't have any concrete proof. Yet he still made her that offer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#5",
        "name2": "char_242_mayer#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Really? I thought that was pretty reckless of him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mayer"
    },
    {
        "text": "If Robin wasn't there to kill him, and she tipped him off to the jailers, what happens then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mayer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#1",
        "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hehe, that's the part that I like about him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#5",
        "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Think about it. You're a fresh fish. No one knows who you are. Meanwhile, Anthony's built a reputation, a prestige for himself over the years.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whose words do you think carry more weight?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's take a step back. Say Barton and the guards there really believed her. Could they have done anything about that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "text": "They couldn't have acted on that information.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#5",
        "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, now that you mention it, I guess there wasn't much they could've done even if she ratted him out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mayer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#1",
        "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hehe, you think it's reckless, and you'd be right under normal circumstances. It's a risky move if he didn't have his 'prestige,' or perhaps 'influence' is the better word to use here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "text": "But what I think is really interesting is that\u2014Those who know how to build prestige for themselves don't usually do something like that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#5",
        "name2": "char_242_mayer#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm, and why's that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mayer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#5",
        "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's because what he said was also a threat. He was telling her, 'You could tell him, but it's not going to do you any good.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "text": "When you hear that, it doesn't really sound like something that someone who's really got prestige would say, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#5",
        "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh, you're right. It does sound like a threat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mayer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#5",
        "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's what I mean. Besides, did Anthony ever say anything about what he did to appease Barton?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#5",
        "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm? Oh... he said he volunteered to be put in solitary for half a month.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mayer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#4",
        "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone knew that he wasn't the one at fault, but he chose to be punished to get this thing behind them, huh...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#1",
        "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I can almost imagine that grin on Barton's face when Anthony told him he was willing to accept punishment.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#5",
        "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But he still held back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#1",
        "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Tsk tsk, such a hard guy to deal with.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#5",
        "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I think he probably just figured Robin wouldn't rat him out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mayer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#4",
        "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm... it's possible. I won't deny it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#3",
        "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "By the way, Ms. Silence is really taking her time, isn't she?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#5",
        "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, you're right. I'll go take a look.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mayer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
